---
source: crates/daemon/tests/cli_help.rs
expression: stdout
---
Set a config value

Usage: mxr config set [OPTIONS] <KEY> <VALUE>

Arguments:
  <KEY>    Dotted key path (e.g. general.sync_interval, appearance.theme)
  <VALUE>  Value to set

Options:
      --dry-run  Show the change without writing config.toml
  -h, --help     Print help
